    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a thrilling arcade game where players slice fruits. It can be played on a PC using a mouse. By moving the cursor across the screen, players simulate a blade to cut fruits, earning points with each successful slice. The objective is to score as many points as possible by cutting as many fruits as you can. Using a mouse provides smooth and responsive control, making the gameplay just as exciting and fast-paced. It's perfect for sharpening reflexes and enjoying quick-action gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hentai World Slice with a mouse offers a fresh experience, delivering precise control and swift movements. The game's vibrant visuals and satisfying sound effects. Whether you're chasing a high score or simply having fun slicing fruits, this game offers an addictive, action-packed adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530080/extras/5bf2fc3033226b5b2ca0eb25784420ec.avif?t=1741390273\" width=500 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and stylish design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-screen mode available after game completion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting and immersive experience! Forget about time or scores\u2014just enjoy the fun moments and dive into the game's colorful world!</p>",
